# Marp decks embed a `style: |` YAML frontmatter block. Some prettier/markdown
# formatters collapse that multi-line block (observed: 22 lines → the token
# `span`), which silently breaks rendering while leaving the body intact.
# Keep presentation markdown out of any prettier run. NOTE: this only guards
# contributors who run prettier in-repo — it cannot change a local editor's
# own format-on-save; fix that in the editor config.
presentations/**/*.md
